# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://rangka-os.github.io/rangka-os/schema/0.5/module.json
name: shifts
version: 1.0.0
title: {id: Jadwal shift, en: Work shifts}
summary:
  id: Pola shift per outlet, jadwal mingguan yang diterbitkan, jadwal tiap karyawan, tukar shift, dan absen dibandingkan dengan jadwal.
  en: Shift patterns per outlet, a published weekly roster, each employee's schedule, shift swaps, and attendance against the schedule.
category: people
icon: calendar-line
# Work schedules of outlet staff (rangka-apps#120, tasks T1 to T5). A work shift is planned time; the cash drawer session
# (pos_shift, module pos) is something else: it links to the work shift when the cashier has one, never needs it.
# With module attendance, a clock-in links to the employee's published shift of that day and lateness is measured
# against the shift instead of the outlet's default hours; flow shift_attendance_sync marks each shift present, late or
# absent. The kernel clock screen's own shift slot (clock.shift, rangka-os 0030 known gap) is a later task.
requires: {rangka: '>=0.5', users: ^1.5, outlets: ^1.6}
optional: {attendance: ^1.1, pos: ^1.6}
